# What this repository holds: everything needed to build the site and to run an edition (content, site, editorial,
# monitor, scripts, the drafting skills, the chart data). What it leaves out is below.

# Build output. GitHub builds the public site from the sources (.github/workflows/pages.yml).
dist/
preview/

# The monitor's raw scan output and the cache of fetched sources. Both are regenerated on the next run, and the
# cache holds the text of other people's papers, which is not ours to redistribute.
data/cache/
data/candidates/

# The editor's working papers: run reports and logs, the pilot's research notes and one-off scripts, earlier
# designs and mockups, and session notes. They stay on the editor's machine.
data/runs/
data/pilot/
archive/
mockups/
HANDOFF.md

# Local settings and system files
.claude/settings.local.json
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
